    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pure Chinese 3D First-Person Detective Series Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The\u00a0Meiqi Series is a Chinese style full 3D detective game, it tells the story of detective Liu Qingchun from the contact of Sun Meiqi secret room murder case began a series of mysterious cases and strange events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196310/extras/52797b5de26be79622da44152bda3815.avif?t=1741407949\" width=616 height=196 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This uniquely rich narrative puzzle game combines deduction-focused gameplay with a non-linear storytelling approach, incorporating traditional Chinese-style micro-horror elements and a realistic 3D art style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story of Meiqi 2024 unfolds as Liu Qingchun, the bureau chief, personally investigates cases handled by the 403 Intelligence Division. This season features six distinct cases for you to solve.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196310/extras/c7045088b7d6ec4a52f9d4343953d86d.avif?t=1741407949\" width=616 height=196 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Last time, after falling asleep at home, I somehow entered a distorted dream where the setting was my own bedroom. This time, however, I have no idea where I am.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196310/extras/4bc0df6e4162cae4005137e9b2caccc5.avif?t=1741407949\" width=616 height=196 /></span>Revenge is human nature, but it often brings more pain and destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Continue to delve into the 1990s of Hepingli as Liu Qingchun, and under the mysterious threat of Lang Yun and Wen San, uncover the ultimate mystery of human nature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time is a long river, we can only go with the flow, but we cannot go against it, and it will eventually reveal everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196310/extras/0c4cfed2ef1724381c85e32f7308dbe0.avif?t=1741407949\" width=616 height=196 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Truth? It's right there, within your grasp. Don't you see it coming? What a pity, every time you reach out to grab it, it dissipates like smoke. How ridiculous! You think you can unravel the mystery with your intelligence? Pathetic and laughable! Your so-called strong will is merely a struggle against your own shadow. Look at you struggling along the way, just like those clowns who try to change their fate. In the end, no matter how you struggle, you can't escape being toyed with by the truth! --WenSanRen</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196310/extras/363054f2e6be9fcc1bcdd251f8d1e36e.avif?t=1741407949\" width=616 height=196 /></span>The case is still unfolding. Upon entering the Chemical Bureau dormitory, Liu Qingchun inexplicably felt a strange sense of unease, as if something unseen was lurking around him. In the ensuing exploration, he would confront the dual impact of reality and illusion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wen Sanren and Wang Zhiqiang have vanished without a trace, while Li Shufu and Liu Yanhong are also missing. And the woman named &quot;Bai Lian&quot; - who was supposed to have died years ago - has reappeared like a ghost in this place, seemingly hinting at something. The case is far more complex than it appears, and there seems to be a more horrifying truth lurking beneath the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Having ventured into the Chemical Bureau dormitory alone, can Liu Qingchun unravel this mystery, or will he become a victim of unknown forces? The truth is about to be revealed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196310/extras/b77250ea786a97ebad004a1cd6ba1837.avif?t=1741407949\" width=616 height=196 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The case took an unexpected turn when another murder occurred, complicating what had seemed like a simple incident.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the mysterious Wen Sanren involved, the case became even more convoluted. The disappearances of Li Shufu and Li Bai Si added a layer of fog, drawing Liu Qingchun deeper into a dark abyss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Continuing his search for clues in the Chemical Bureau dormitory, he proceeded cautiously, leaving no stone unturned. With the assistance of the 403 Intelligence Department, he began to uncover the secrets hidden beneath the everyday lives of each person involved. Through on-site investigations and calm reasoning, he gradually peeled back the layers of their inner &quot;underworlds.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battle between justice and evil will continue on this invisible battlefield until the truth is revealed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196310/extras/6ac5b65f3e5363cd707e60b41e8dcdff.avif?t=1741407949\" width=616 height=196 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hado: Report! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liu Qingchun: Come in, what is it? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hado: There's a case in Pingheli East Street that meets the 403 criteria. It has entered the approval process. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liu Qingchun: What kind of case? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hado: A man, armed with a knife, injured three people and killed a neighboring girl. The symptoms are the same as Wang Aiguo's back then, a loss of self-control. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liu Qingchun: Right, have you found anything according to the bamboo slips and the location of the Phoenix Chamber? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hado: Yes, I've handed it over to the 403 Intelligence Department. It's a &quot;compass.&quot; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liu Qingchun: I'll take this case personally.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MeiQi 2024 is a narrative puzzle game, the latest installment in the MeiQi series. <br>Liu Qingchun, as the bureau chief, personally investigates the cases of the 403 Intelligence Division. <br>There are 6 different cases in this season for you to solve. <br>You can freely switch between first-person and third-person perspectives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Due to being developed by a single person, guidance is relatively weak. <br>This work contains a lot of reasoning, puzzles, and some horror elements. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Developed by a Single Independent Developer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hello everyone, my name is Q\u53d4. Welcome to the world of puzzle games from QZQ Studio. MeiQi  2024 is the newest work in the MeiQi universe. I am a passionate solo game developer who has been developing suspense puzzle games. Previous works include the &quot;Meiqi Mystery&quot; series and the &quot;Lin Shanhai Detective Collection&quot; series. I really enjoy what I do now, and I will be active on social media and in groups. You can find me on Bilibili/Xiaohongshu/Douyin/QQ group. Feel free to contact me. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MeiQiSeries</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The MeiQi Series includes all works from 2019 to 2024.    </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Abnormal 1999 Series</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Abnormal 1999 series is a spin-off of the Sun Meiqi universe, telling the story and adventures of SU. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They are &quot;Silence&quot;, &quot;Killer Apartment&quot;, &quot;SU&quot;, &quot;Hyperspace&quot;, &quot;Area 49&quot;, and &quot;The Compass and the Sand&quot;.</p>",
